Settings: switch optional SMS assistance off then on; separately select Ask/Email/SMS bank-code delivery.

10
00:00:59.001 --> 00:01:04.951
Email sets the preferred delivery channel when offered. SMS is restored afterwards for the other walkthroughs.

11
